import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 433 | Dragon Ball · Energy-Waste Analysis: Zeno-Tier Aptitude Used for Personal Combat","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 433 | Dragon Ball · Energy-Waste Analysis: Zeno-Tier Aptitude Used for Personal Combat","no":433,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Energy Waste","Goku","God of Destruction","Zeno"],"related":["17-Plane Transcendent Standards","24-Anchor Energy Conduction Path","26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0433_模块2-龙珠-能级浪费解析-全王级资质用于个人战斗.md","filePath":"en/0433_模块2-龙珠-能级浪费解析-全王级资质用于个人战斗.md"}'),a={name:"en/0433_模块2-龙珠-能级浪费解析-全王级资质用于个人战斗.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,h,c){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-433-dragon-ball-·-energy-waste-analysis-zeno-tier-aptitude-used-for-personal-combat" tabindex="-1">Entry 433 | Dragon Ball · Energy-Waste Analysis: Zeno-Tier Aptitude Used for Personal Combat <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-433-dragon-ball-·-energy-waste-analysis-zeno-tier-aptitude-used-for-personal-combat" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 433 | Dragon Ball · Energy-Waste Analysis: Zeno-Tier Aptitude Used for Personal Combat&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 2) | Benchmark base: Documents 17, 24, 26</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-cosmos-tier-power-serves-only-one-martial-arts-match" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when cosmos-tier power serves only one martial-arts match <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-cosmos-tier-power-serves-only-one-martial-arts-match" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when cosmos-tier power serves only one martial-arts match&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou judges a strong one&#39;s energy not by &quot;how strong he can hit,&quot; but by &quot;how much civilization gets stronger because of him.&quot; Goku&#39;s combat-power curve is the steepest in comics history: from a boy flipping cars bare-handed, to a Super Saiyan punching stars, to Super Saiyan Blue arm-wrestling Gods of Destruction, to the Ultra Instinct realm &quot;even gods must study.&quot; This energy in the Myriad-Realms lineage is top-tier, yet his share directed to civilization is almost zero. This entry, by the law-first axiom (law precedes, never retcons) and anti-energy-waste lens, dissects Dragon Ball system&#39;s energy mismatch layer by layer.</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s energy waste can be split into four dimensions:</p><ul><li><strong>Race dimension</strong>: Saiyan near-death-revival gain is a cosmos-rare &quot;life—combat&quot; conversion mechanism, but it only serves the Saiyan race. Namekians, Earthlings, Frieza-army subordinate races — none gained theoretical or technical feedback from this biological miracle</li><li><strong>Tier dimension</strong>: Kaioken, Spirit Bomb, Instant Transmission, Ultra Instinct — these top skills all passed within Goku&#39;s family by mouth; Earth&#39;s &quot;ki&quot; theory remains at Turtle School&#39;s master-apprentice system, never textbook-ified, academified</li><li><strong>Object dimension</strong>: Beerus the God of Destruction willing to spar with Goku, Whis the Angel willing to coach him, Zeno willing to play Tournament of Power with him — the cosmos&#39;s top mentor resources and political resources all poured on one person; other cosmos beings do not even have auditor qualification</li><li><strong>Use dimension</strong>: every breakthrough&#39;s only use is &quot;defeat the next villain.&quot; Goku never used Spirit Bomb to heal a destroyed planet, never used Instant Transmission to build a cross-star medical network, never used Ultra Instinct&#39;s perception to early-warn the next cosmos-tier disaster</li></ul><p>Conclusion: <strong>Zeno-tier aptitude, martial-artist-tier use.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball world&#39;s energy waste directly feeds historical regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Knowledge does not spill</strong>: every Goku breakthrough does not enter the public knowledge base; Earth civilization&#39;s cultivation level in forty years of plot almost stands still — Krillin, Tien Shinhan, Yamcha these early strong ones late become complete backdrop; not that they did not work hard, but the system did not give them a road</li><li><strong>Disasters repeat</strong>: because Goku&#39;s energy never converted into a defense system, Frieza came, Cell came, Buu came, Beerus came, Moro came — the same disaster pattern with different villains acted for fifty years</li><li><strong>Wish rollback erases lessons</strong>: after every disaster Dragon Balls revive the dead, restore cities; civilization has no &quot;having suffered&quot; memory; next time the same mistake is repeated</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s predatory thinking is &quot;innocent type,&quot; but structurally equally valid:</p><ul><li><strong>Top attention monopolized</strong>: Whis, Beerus, Zeno could have spent time reforming Universe 10, balancing Universe 6 and 7 ecology, yet all used to &quot;play&quot; with Goku — this is personal occupation of cosmos-tier public resources</li><li><strong>Training opportunities hoarded</strong>: skills Goku learned in the Hyperbolic Time Chamber, on Whis&#39;s planet, on Yardrat, never systematically taught to Earth companions; Vegeta got to play because he chased to learn, not because Goku proactively opened up</li><li><strong>Enemy suffering entertainment-ified</strong>: Frieza destroying Planet Vegeta, Namek&#39;s entire race, in narrative ultimately all became &quot;emotional fuel for Goku to become Super Saiyan&quot; — Myriad Ranks&#39; suffering compressed into the protagonist&#39;s pre-transformation backstory</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Energy Mismatch</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Saiyan near-death gain privatized</td><td>Life-cycle system (Doc 012) public; Myriad Ranks share safe life-energy conversion technology</td></tr><tr><td>Top skills master-apprentice oral</td><td>300 Origin cultivation systems fully open; methods textbook-ified, academified</td></tr><tr><td>God-tier mentors only with Goku</td><td>Cross-plane mentor network; Alaya whole-network shared; Myriad Ranks 99% coverage</td></tr><tr><td>Breakthrough only to win</td><td>Energy by &quot;strength 40 / mind 25 / contribution 20 / responsibility 15&quot; four-dimensional exam; contribution + responsibility = 35%</td></tr><tr><td>Disaster by wish rollback</td><td>Causal self-discipline axiom: observe first then limited interference; civilization memory must not be erased</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Goku&#39;s energy curve — 10 → 416 → 8000 → Super Saiyan 150 million → Super Saiyan God → God-of-Destruction tier</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Goku makes ki theory public,&quot; &quot;Goku opens the Hyperbolic Time Chamber,&quot; &quot;Goku leads Earth to build an interstellar alliance&quot; three controls</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count Earth per-capita combat power, Namek reconstruction rate, Galaxy Force standing combat power</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Goku Energy-Spillover Report</em>, quantifying &quot;if Goku used 30% of energy for civilization construction, how many years earlier would Earth enter the interstellar age&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: low</strong>. &quot;Ki&quot; magnitude early had a rough reference (Master Roshi 139, Raditz ~1000); by Frieza arc jumps directly to 100 million; thereafter numbers completely abandoned, changed to &quot;who plot needs who is strong&quot;</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely high</strong>. Goku&#39;s transformation layers (SSJ1/2/3, God, Blue, Sign, Mastered UI, Selfishness) each layer is &quot;couldn&#39;t beat plot so add another layer&quot;; no a priori realm cap</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high (gift-style-leaning-oligarchic)</strong>. Whis, Beerus, Zeno&#39;s favoritism of Goku is itself &quot;grace&quot;; other beings get no such treatment</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Zeno-tier aptitude for personal combat; civilization zero spillover</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: top god-tier mentor resources monopolized by Goku alone</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least built Peerless Academy; Goku did not even write a ki textbook</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Earth commoners, Namekians, Yardrats all not included in cultivation universal benefit</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Goku&#39;s energy ceiling (Ultra Instinct) still defined within the worldview by the god-tier stratum; Myriad Ranks have no legislative participation</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku is not a greedy person, but he lives in a system where &quot;the higher the energy, the more it belongs only to oneself.&quot; What Heng Yuan Zhou wants to ask is not whether Goku is good, but: when one person can sense the whole cosmos&#39;s ki, why does he never turn this perception into Myriad Ranks&#39; streetlamp? The answer is not in Goku&#39;s character, but that Dragon Ball&#39;s worldview from the start had no axiom of &quot;energy should feed back to civilization.&quot; Supplementing this axiom is Dragon Ball-style cosmos&#39;s true exit.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · energy-waste analysis · Zeno-tier aptitude used for personal combat described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./432_模块2-龙珠-总论悟空与战力膨胀体系定性.html">Entry 432 · Overview</a> · <a href="./451_模块2-龙珠-悟空vs衡元宙-个人战力与万族共生的分野.html">Entry 451 · Goku vs. Heng Yuan Zhou</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standards</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const g=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
